<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Waannisa Qonccitha</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waannisa Qonccitha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waannisa Qonccitha</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wan. Qon.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waannisa Qonccithayis</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Waannisa qonccithay, ammaniza asay Yesuus Kiristtoosana paas God udii ammaneez gishonnee, geeshshetithar yezeez gishos unttan metonnee waaye helleez wodayid xaafintteeza. Xaafay caddii be7eez aafe qofay, ammaniza asay ufayssay kunthi maaqqoday garkk unttan minthathii, unttan helleez bayi7ithi baggannee meto gancce fa ammanayir miinggii eqqod garkk denthithodayisii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yha Maxaafayis undenna kifilitay gaamennee kaali kaallii qoncceez qonccithita aykkiza. Yha qoncithitay ye wode yez asayis geliza, zin yhankkitayis xuura maaqqii gam7izannee Unttii aaziso misiler odintteeza. Mazmuure azimaachche maaqqii maaqqii yexxinttizay garkk, ye maxaafayid yez waanna qofitay duma duma qonccithitay baggar duma duma oger maaqqii maaqqii shiiqeeza. Yha maxaafay bili7ithayis duma duma qofay yezikokka, ees waanna qofay qoncce. Yeykka, «Xoossii Goda Kiristtoosa baggar lamisowa oger fa morkkita, Xalahera gujjii, pettii tokennee wurssii gamoda. Ye gamithaypp guye, ees ammaninttii yezeez fa baggita oroth salonnee oroth sa7a anjjo laatisoda» yeegizaya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Waannisa qonccithay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laappun woosa keethitayis inggintteez kiitannee bilitha <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:9-20">1:9-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laappun woosa keethitayis xaafintteez kiitita <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 2:1-3:22">2:1—3:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Zufaane, xaath maxaaferannee Laappun maatamita <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 4:1-8:1">4:1—8:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laappun naassitta <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 8:2-11:19">8:2—11:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawannee nam77ii do7ita <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 12:1-13:18">12:1—13:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Duma duma qonccithita <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 14:1-15:8">14:1—15:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laappun Xooss kachchii xuu7ita <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 16:1-21">16:1-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baabiloone dhaba, do7annee worddo nabennee daabuloosa gamintta <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 17:1-20:10">17:1—20:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssith pirdda <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 20:11-15">20:11-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Oroth salo, oroth sa7annee oroth Yerusalaame <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 21:1-22:5">21:1—22:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 22:6-21">22:6-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Ellera hanodayis yeza baz fa ayllita beezoday garkk Xoossii ees inggeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa qonccithay yhaya. Yesuusa fa kiitanchcha kiittii, fa aylle Waannisas qonciseeza. <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>Waannisa Xoossa qaala, Yesuus Kiristtoosa ootheezibazinnee be7eezi baz ubba markkatteeza. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Yha ubbay hanodayis wode helleez gishos yha tinbbite qaala nabbabiza ookka anjjintteezaya. Ma yha qaala si7izitayinnee xaafintteez kiita naagiza ubbay anjjetteezita.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappun Iisa woosa keethitayis kiitintteez sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="REV 1:4-5"/>Yha dabddaabbay, Waannisapp, Iisa biitta yez laappun woosa keethitayis xaafintteeza. Binkka, yhattekka yez, tiinapekka ye7odayis yez Xoossaypp, ma e zufaanay tiina yez laappun ayyaanataypp, yhay garkk, yhayiqoppe dendor tiina maaqqeezaypp, sa7a kaatita moodiza ammanintteez markka maaqqeez Yesuus Kiristtoosapp, aadho keehatithinnee sarotith yinttis maaqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kes. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">Wan. Qon. 4:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4-5">Yesuusa nuna dosiza, ma fa suuthar nagara aylletithap nuna wozii kesseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:4">Isa. 55:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:27">Maz. 89:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>Nuunii Yesuus Kiristtoosa Adayis Xoossayis oothoday garkk nuna kaatetithitannee qeesita maheez Ees medhinappe medhina hellodayis bonchchonnee wolqqa maaqqo. Amin77ii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kes. 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">Wan. Qon. 5:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>Yikkee, Yesuusa shaarara ye7oda. As ubbay hara attozin, eza caddeez asaykka eza be7ada. Sa7all yez as ubbay e gishos yeekkoda. Yeyi tuma hanoda! Amin77ii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat. 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mar. 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Luq. 21:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:17">1 Tes. 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:34">Wan. 19:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>Binkka, yhattekka yezay, tiinapekka ye7od Goday, Ubbapp Wolqqama Xoossay,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:13">Wan. Qon. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kes. 3:14</ref></char></note> «Alfannee Oomega tana»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Alfannee Oomega: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonar Alfannee Oomega koyronnee wurssitha pidaalita; birshshethaykka dendonnee wurssithii guussii.</char></note> yeegiza Goday Xoossay.<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirissttoosa qonccithar benttith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Taanii, Waannisa, yi ishay, yinttar pettipp Yesuusar e meto, e kaatetithannee e danda7a be7eeza. Taanii Xooss qaala gishonnee Yesuusabaz markkatteez gishos Piximo giz haathar marintteez biittal ta yeza. <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Goday gallas ta Ayyanar yeza; taapp guyer tutulo pugo garkk gita giirthi ta si7eeza. <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>Ye giirthay tana, «Ne bi7izana maxaafayid xaafii, Iisa yez laappun woosa keethitayis, Efesoones, Samirnneesas, Pherggamoonas, Tiyaixiroonas, Sarddeesas, Filaadelfasinnee Loodoqas dakkoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Taanii taas odiza giirtha be7adayis guye maaqqii xomppe gaddiz laappun worqqa kochchita be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>Ye kochchitay gancce as na7a aazizana ta be7eeza. E aduss afila fa toke helthii ma77eeza, worqqa danccor fa tira dancceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">Daan. 10:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>E ommayinnee e binnanay booth dur ikise garkkennee shachch garkke; e aafaykka tama lathi aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Daan. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/>E tokay tamar teeleez zoqqeez naase biraata aaziza; e girthaykka gita gaame haathitay ooshshich garkke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Iziqe. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>E fa ushachch kusher laappun xoolinttita aykkeeza. E doonaypp nam7i baggar leefintteez oco mashsha kezeeza. E sinay seeta gallasa awa aafe aaziza.<verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Taanii eza be7eez wode yhayqqeez as garkk hanii e toke achcha pokkeeza. E fa ushachcha kushe taal afa gaddii, «Yashittippe; Tiinay Wurssithay tana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">Wan. Qon. 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/>Taanii yezaya; taanii yhayqqeeza zin medh medhinaskka path yeza. Yhayiqonnee Si7oole qulppe ta kushe yeza. <verse eid="REV 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>Yikkee, yhatti hanizabazinnee tiinapp hanod baz ne be7eezi baz xaafoba. <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/>Neenii ta ushachch kushayid be7eez laappun xoolinttitannee laappun worqqa kochchitay bili7ithay yhay: Laappun xoolinttitay laappun woosa keethitay kiitanchchita; laappun worqqa kochchitay laappun woosa keethita.»<verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Efesoone woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>«Efesoona woosa keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:1">Fa ushachch kusher laappun xoolinttita aykkeezayinnee laappun worqqa kochchitay ganccer yedhdhizay yhay garkk yeegiza: <verse eid="REV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>Taanii ne oosa, ne daaburannee ne garzha eriza. Neenii iita asitayibagga garzhodayis danda7ekkaza ta eriza. Ma hawaare baazir fana, hawaare gizita pilagii erii unttii worddanicho maaqqeezana denggeezana ta eriza. <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/>Neenii garzhor miingeezanannee ta sunthay gishos doli7ekkazar meto ekkeezana ta eriza. <verse eid="REV 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>Hano zin, yhatti ta nena borizabaz yeza; yeykka neenii ne tiina siiqa ashsheeza. <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/>Yikkee, ne ab garkk dhoqqa aqopp pokkeezako qopoba! Maarotith geloba; neenii kase oothiza oosa oothoba. Yeya ubba ne oothaam ixxikko ta neeko ye7oda. Neenii maarotith gelaam ixiko, ne xomppe gaddiza kochcha ya aqaypp ekkoda. <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/>Yhatti ta nena nashshichchiza pettibaz yeza; ta ixxiza Niqolawutay oosa neekka ixxeeza.<verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7odayis haye yez oonkka si7o. Gameez oonkka Xooss gennette yez de7o mith aafepp maaday garkk mawute immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Medhe. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Wan. Qon. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:13">Iziqe. 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samirneesa woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>«Samirnneesa woosa keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Wan. Qon. 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:8">Tiinayinnee wurssithay, yhayqqeezaynnee yhayiqopp denddeezay yhay garkk yeegiza:<verse eid="REV 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>Taanii ne metannee ne manqqotitha eriza; maaqqozin neenii dure. Xalahe maabara yezitay, Ayihude baazin fana Ayihude gizitayi nena cazhiza cashsha ta eriza. <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>Neenii ekkodayis yez meta yashittippe. Daabuloosa yinttipp pettita pettita faaccodayis achch keeth gelisoday; taphphii gallas hellodayis yi metinttoda. Yhayqqod hellodayis ammanintteeza maaqqoba; ta nees de7o zawude inggoda.<verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz haye yez oonkka si7o. Gamiz oonkka nam7intho yhayiqor qohinttenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">Wan. Qon. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">21:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pherggamoona woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>«Pherggamoonee woosa keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:12">Nam7i baggar leepintteez mashsha yezay yhay garkk yeegiza: <verse eid="REV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>Taanii ne yez aqa eriza; neenii Xalahe zufaanay yez aqo yeza; ta suntha ne miinthii aykkeeza. Hara attozin, Xalahe yez yi katamayi yhayqqeez taas ammanintteez markkay, Antiphaasa, yez wodekka ammana ashshekkaya.<verse eid="REV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>Hano zin, ta nena boriza pettibazii yeza. Yeykka Isreele asay eeqas yarshshintteez katha mi tunodagarkkennee iita oosos zhimbaro nagara oothod garkk Baalaqana taamarsseez Balaama timirtta ekkeez pettii pettii asitay neera yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Tay. 22:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/>Yey garkkekka, Niqolawitay timirtta tamaariza asitay neera yeza. <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>Yeyi gishos, neenii ne nagaraypp maaqqoba. Yeyi hanaam ixxiko, ta neeko ellisii yi7ii ye asita ta doonaypp keziz qaala mashshayir oloda.<verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz hayer yez oonkka si7o. Gamiz ooskka qosinttii yez manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Manna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isreele asay liizho biitta yedhdhodar salopp Xoossii unttis inggeez duma katha woy kiitanchcho quma.</char></note> immada. Oroth sunthay xaafintteez booth shuchcha ta ees immada. Yeya ekkizaypp attin hara oonkka erooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:14">Kes. 16:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiyaxiroona woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>«Tiyaxiroona woosa keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:18">Tama lath aaziz aafe yezay, ma tamar teeleez naase biraata aaziz tok yezay, Xooss na7ay, yhay garkk yeegiza: <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>Taanii ne oosa, ne siiqa, ne ammana, ne Xoossis oothizayannee ne garzha eriza. Neenii tiina oothizaypp yhatti aadho oothizanakka ta eriza.<verse eid="REV 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>Hano zin, ta nena boriza pettibaz yeza; fana nabe giz asit, Elzabelii bagga, shenakko gi asheeza. Ye asita eeqas yarshshintteez katha mi tunoday garkkennee lagitod garkk udii ta ayllita balitheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Kaat. 16:31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2 Kaat. 9:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/>Iza fa nagaraypp maaqqoday garkk ta iis wode inggeeza, zin iza maaqqodayis koyekkaya. <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>Yeyi gishos ta izo iita hargger arssal oloda. Iir lagitizitaykka fa iita oosaypp maaqqaam ixxiko; iita metol oloda. <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/>Taanii I na7itakka wodhoda; ma woosa keeth ubbay ta as qofannee as wozina erizaya maaqqeezana eroda. Ta pettayis pettayis e oosay garkk immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Maz. 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Erim. 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>Tiyatiroona yez yhankkita, ye iita timirtta ekkekkazitaynnee, «Xalahe gita xuura» ginttinttiz yha timirtta tamaarekka yinttan hara deexo toofo toossaamii. <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/>Hano zin, ta ye7od hellodayis yinttis yeza baz miinthii naagoytta.<verse eid="REV 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>Gamizayinnee wurssith hellodayis taas kiitinttiza ooskka woya ubbayil mawute immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-9">Maz. 2:8-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/>«‹E unttan biraata gufera haaroday;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 2:27">zhiicepp oothintteez miishe garkkekka tinchchii liqisoda.›</para>
  <para style="mi" vid="REV 2:27">Ye mawuta taanii ta adaypp ekkeez mawutay garkke. <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/>Ma ta ees bakkala xoolintto immada. <verse eid="REV 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz haye yez oonkka si7o.<verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Sarddeesa woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>«Serddeese woos keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:1">Laappun Xooss ayyaanitannee laappun xoolinttita aykkeezay yhay garkk yeegiza: Taanii ne oosa eriza; sunthis ne path yeza zini, ne yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/>Barkkoba! Yhayqqodayis helleezitanne atteez Xiqqa wolqqa minthoba. Ne oosay ta Xoossay tiina folo maaqqii benttekkaya. <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/>Yikkee, ne ekkeezibazinnee si7eezibaz akakoba; naagoba; ne nagaraypp maaqqoba. Neenii barkkaam ixxiko ta ne qopekkazin kayzo garkk neeko ye7oda; ta aba wode ye7odazako ne erooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>Zini fa ma7o qitisoowa xiqqa asitay Sarddeesa yeza. Unttis beeziza baz maaqqeez gishos booth ma7o ma77ii taar yedhdhoda. <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/>Gamiz oonkka unttiisay garkk booth ma7o ma77oda. Taanii e suntha de7o maxaapaypp uccaamii. Taanii ta Aday tiinannee ta Aday kiitanchchitay tiina E tabaz maaqqeezana markkattoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kes. 32:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz hayer yez oonkka si7o.<verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filaadelfa woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>«Filaadelfa woosa keeth kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:7">Geeshshinnee tumanchchay, Dawute qulppe fa kushe aykkeezay, yhay garkk yeegiza: e gorddin oonkka dooyodayis danda7ooya; ma E dooyin oonkka gorddodayis danda7oowa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:22">Isa. 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">Iyo. 12:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/>Taanii ne oosa eriza; yikkee ta ne tiina oonkka gorddodayis danda7oowa dooya penge gaddeeza. Ne wolqqay xiqqa maaqqikokka, ta qaala naageeza; tana kaddekkaya. <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/>Ayihude baazar fana Ayihude giz wordditannee Xalahe baggita neeko ko7odannee ne tiina xugunthoda. Ta nena dosizaya unttan erisoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:23">Isa. 49:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:4">Isa. 43:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>Neenii, ‹Garzhoba› gi ta kiitteez kiita naageez gishos kunth alama faacodayis ye7od waaye wodaypp taanii nena naagoda.<verse eid="REV 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>Taanii ellisii ye7od; oonkka ne zawuda ekkaamay garkk nees yeza baz miinthii aykkoba. <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/>Gameezana ta Xooss kara tuuss udoda; e ezayid medhinas yezoda. Taanii ta Xoossay sunthannee ta Xoossay katamay suntha ezal afa xaafoda; izakka ta Xooss kalepp wodhdhiz oroth Yerusalaame. Ma ta ta oroth sunthakka ezal afa xaafoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Wan. Qon. 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa. 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz haye yez oonkka si7o.»<verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Loodoqa woosa keethis kiitintteez kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>«Loodoqa woosa keetha kiitanchchayis yhay garkk yeegii xaafoba.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:14">‹Amin77ii› maaqqeez ammanintteez tuma markkay, Xooss medhetith ubba haarizay yhay garkk yeegiza:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:22">Aazi. 8:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>Taanii ne oosa ubba eriza; neenii irxxa woy misha maaqqekka; neenii nam7aypp petta maaqqiko lo77o! <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>Neenii irxxa woy misha baa boli7o maaqqeez gishos ta nena ta doonaypp cuttodayis haniza. <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/>Yikkee, neenii, ‹Taanii dure, gaame shalor yeza, taas abikka paccekkaya› ne yeegiza. Zini neenii sonqqeezaya, manqqo, to7annee kallotteezana maaqqeezana erooya. <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>Yeyi gishos, ne duritodayis tamar geezheez worqqa, ne yeella kallo kammodayis booth ma7onnee loyth be7adayis maaddiza aafe dhale taapp wonggoday garkk ta nena zoriza.<verse eid="REV 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>Ta ta dosizita kacizannee seeriza; yikkee luuloba; ne nagaraypp maaqqoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Aazi. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Ibr. 12:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>Yeezako, ta baler eqqii xeegoda. Oonkka ta xeessa si7ii, gazara dooyiko, ta eeko geloda; ezar pettipp katha maada; eekka taara pettipp maada.<verse eid="REV 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>Ta gamii ta Adayira e zufaanayel betteezay garkk gameezay taara ta zufaanayil bettoday garkk mawute inggoda. <verse eid="REV 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>Ayyanay woosa keethitayis gizibaz si7iz hayer yez oonkka si7o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Salo yez goynno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Yeypp guye, taanii be7eeza, salo dooyintteez penge yeza. Ma ta tiina si7eez tulitulo girss garkkezay taako, «Yhankka kezoba; yhaypp guye, hanodayis yeza baz ta nena beezoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>Ye wode ta Ayyanar kumii yeza. Yikkee, salo zufaane be7eeza zufaanayil afa petta beteezana be7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Iziqe. 1:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:1">10:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Ye betteezay malay iyasiphedennee sarddiyoona giz al7o shuchchay garkk. E zufaanay yuushayid al7o mergede shuchch aaziz zuullay yeza. <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Ye zufaanay yuushayid laatamannee oydd zufaanitay yeza; unttal afa booth ma7o ma77ii, ommal worqqa zawude gaddeez laatamannee oydd cimitay betteeza. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Zufaanaypp zeelinth, dada guumthinnee saaritha keziza. Zufaane tiina laappun poo7iza tama xomppitay yeza; unttii laappun Xooss ayyanita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kes. 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:4">Wan. Qon. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">Wan. Qon. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:13">Iziqe. 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zak. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Zufaanay tiina birille aaziza fociz burccuko abbay yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:22">Iziqe. 1:22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Tiinarannee guyer aafe kumeez shemppor yez oyddii medhetithitay zufaanay yuushayirannee zufaanay gancce yeza. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/>Tiina medhetithay gaammo aaziza; nam7inthay gemate aaziza; hayidzanthay tiinayir as aaziza; ma oyddinthay piradhdhiza ankko aaziza. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Oydd medhetethitay pettayis pettayis usuppun qefitay yeza; ye qefitay afa baggarannee oommo baggar aafe kumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Iziqe. 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:2">Isa. 6:2</ref></char></note> Unttii qammannee gallas gachchekka,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">«Geeshshayyo, geeshshayyo, geeshshayyo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Godayyo, Ubba haariza Xoossayo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Binkka, yhattekka yezayo, tiinapp ye7odayyo»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 4:8">gachchekkazar yeegiza. <verse eid="REV 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Ye medhetethitay zufaanayil beteezayinnee medhinas yezayis Saaba, bonchchonnee galata inggeez wode <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>laatamannee oydd cimitay zufaanel beteezannee medhinas yezay tiina xuggunii goynneeza; fa zawude zufaanay tiina gaddii,<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>«Nu Godayyo, nu Xoossayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Neenii ubba medhdheeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ubba baz ne shene garkk haneezay garkk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">neenii bonchcho, teemannee wolqqa ekkodayis beeziza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 4:11">yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Maxaafannee Dura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Yeypp guye, zufaanayil afa betteezay ushachch kushayid ganccerannee afar xaafinttii laappun maatamer gorddintteez xaath maxafitto ta be7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9">Iziqe. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Pettii mino kiitanchchay fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Maatama bilodayisinnee maxafitto dooyodayis beezizay oonoo?» yeegii awaajjodar ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Zini salo maaqqin sa7a woy sa7app oommo maaqqin ye xaath maxafitto dooyodayisinnee i gancca be7adayis danda7eez oonkka baaya. <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Xaath maxafitto dooyodayisinnee i gancca be7adayis beeziza as dhabeez gishos ta iita yeekkeeza. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Ye wode, cimataypp pettay taako, «Yeekkippe! Yihuda zerethi maaqqeez gaammay, Dawute sheeshay, laappun maatamita billodayisinnee maxatto dooyodayis danda7eeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Medhe. 49:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Yeypp guye, zufaanayil oyddii medhetethitayisinnee cimitayis gancce, shukintteez Dur garkk eqqeezana ta be7eeza. Ees laappun kacitaynnee laappun aafitay yeza. Yeyititay sa7a ubbayil kiitintteez Xooss ayyaan laappunita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zak. 4:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Ye Duray yi7ii, zufaanayil afa beteezay ushachch kushepp xaath maxafitto ekkeeza. <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>E ye xaath maxafitto ekkeez wode oydd medhetithitaynnee laatamannee oydd cimitay Duray tiinayid guphinggeeza. Unttii pettay pettay diithinnee geeshshitay woosa maaqqeez ixaannee kumeez worqqa shaate aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Maz. 141:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>Unttii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">«Xaath maxafitto ekkodayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">maatame bili7odayis nees beeziza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:3">Maz. 33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:10">Isa. 42:10</ref></char>
    </note>Abis giiko, neenii shukintteezaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">zerethi ubbaypp, duma duma doonapp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">yaritappennee kaatetith ubbaypp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ne suuthayir Xoossayis wozeeza.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Nu Xoossayis kaatetithinnee qeese maaqqaday garkk udeeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">unttii biital afa kawutoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">Unttikka gade ubba mooddoday»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:10">yeegii oroth mazmuure yexxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kes. 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">Wan. Qon. 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Ta be7adar zufaanay, oyddii medhetithitaynnee cimitay yuushayid gaame kiitanchchitay yeza. U gaametithay mukulo toke mukulonnee taphphii mukulo toke taphphii mukulo maaqqeez giirtha si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Daan. 7:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>Ye kiitanchchitay dhoqq geez qaalar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">«Shukintteez Duray wolqqa, duretithii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ecetithinnee minotithii, bonchcho, sabannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">anjjo ekkodayis beeziza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:12">yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Yeypp guye, sa7a, salo, sa7app oommorannee abba gancce yez medhetithii ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">«Zufaanel afa beteezayisinnee Durayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">galata, bonchcho, sabannee wolqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">medhippe medhinas maaqqo»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:13">yeegii yexxodar si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Oyddii medhetithitaykka, «Amin77ee» yeegeeza; ma cimitaykka xuggunii goynneeza.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Maatamitay dooyintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Duray laappun maatamitaypp petta dooyodar be7eeza. Ma oyddii medhetithitaypp pettay, dada garkk guumithar, «Yhana ye7oba!» yeegodar ta si7eeza. <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Yeypp booth para ta be7eeza. Ye para toggeezay dongge aykkeeza; e ommayisi zawude inggintteeza. Eekka gamizaya maaqqii gamithapp gamthiko yhammadayis kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:7">Zak. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Ma duray nam7intho maatama dooyeez wode nam7intha medhetithay, «Yhana ye7oba!» yeegodar si7eeza. <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Ma hara siha zoqo para kezeeza. Ye para toggeezayis biittapp saro dhabisoday garkkennee asay woli wursoday garkk mawutennee gita mashsha inggintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:7">Zak. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Duray hayizdizintha maatama dooyeez wode hayidzintha medhetithay, «Yhana ye7oba!» yeegodar ta si7eeza. Yeypp karith para ta be7eeza; parayil betteezay fa kushe mizaane aykkeeza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 6:2">Zak. 6:2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Oyddii medhetithitay ganccepp kezeez giirth, «Bagga kilo gistte; pettii dinnare, maakka pettii kilonnee bagga bangga pettii dinnare maaqqo. Zini zayitennee woyne qohippe» yeegodar si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Duray oyddintho maatama dooyeez wode oyddintho medhetithay, «Yhana ye7oba!» yeegodar si7eeza. <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Yeypp camppa para ta be7eeza. Ye para toggeezay sunthay yhayiqo; e lassa Si7oole kaalliza. Unttis alamayis sikka ola, naye, gadorannee do7ar wodhisoday garkk mawute inggintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Iziqe. 14:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Duray ichchintha maatama dooyeez wode unttii Xooss qaala odeez gishonnee fa markkatithayir ammanintteez gishos shukintteez asay shemppitay yarshsho aqopp oommo yezana ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>Unttii fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Ubba moodiz Godayyo, geeshshayyo, tumanchchayo, sa7a yez asayil afa ne pirddodayinnee nu suuthay gishos kushe kessoday ayide?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Unttis pettayis pettayis booth aduss ma7o inggintteeza. Ugarkk hanii yhayqqodayis beeziza u ayllitay zhamitayinnee ishitay taybay kumod hellodayis xiqqa wode shemppoday garkk unttis odintteeza.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>Duray usuppuntha maatama dooyeez wode ta be7eeza; biitta wolqqama eni7o eni7eeza. Awa aafay kaaritii kaya afila aaziza. Aginaykka zoqqii suuth maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:13">Wan. Qon. 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:10">Erim. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/>Wolqqama carkko carkkii balase mith eni7isin qami7e aafay gufizay garkk salo xoolinttitay sa7all gufeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Salay xaath maxaafe garkk xaaxinttii aadheeza; ambitayinnee haathar marintteez biittitay fa aqaypp dhabeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:20">Wan. Qon. 16:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Gade kaatitay, gade haarizitay, olla kaalithizitay, duritay, wolqqamitay, aylitayinnee, womaannitay kom7itayidannee ambal afa yez zaallitay gancce qosintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">Isa. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>Unttikka ambitaykonnee zaallitayko, «Nuul afa wodhdhoytta; nuna qosoytta; zufaanel afa betteezay tiinayppenne Duray kachchaypp nuna genthoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hosa. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luq. 23:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>U gita kachchii gallasay ye7eeza; oonoo danda7ii eqqoday?» u yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:11">Erim. 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mil. 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Xeetannee oyttamannee oyddii mukulo Isrelita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Yeypp guye, oydd kiitanchchitay oydd sa7a gontte eqqeezita be7eeza. Ye kiitanchchitay sa7all afa woy abbal afa woy aba mithalkka afa carkkay oydd sa7a gaxapp carkkaamay garkk aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:36">Erim. 49:36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Daan. 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:5">Zak. 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Ma de7o Xooss maatame yez hara kiitanchchay awa kess baggapp kezodar ta be7eeza. Ye kiitanchchay fa qaala dhoq udii, sa7annee abba qohodayis wolqqa inggintteez oyddii kiitanchchitayiko, <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>«Nuunii Xooss ayllitay sinayid maatame gaddod hellodayis biitta woy abba woy mitha qohipattee» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Iziqe. 9:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Yeezin, taanii Xooss maatame sino gadintteezitay payida si7eeza. Isra7eele kochch ubbaypp xeetannee oytamanne oydd mukulo asayis sinayil maatame gaddeeza.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Yihuda kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Roobela kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Gade kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>Aseera kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Niftaaleme kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Minaase kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>Simoona kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Lewe kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Yisaakoree kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>Zaabiloone kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Yooseefa kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Biinama kochchapp taphpho nam77ii mukulo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 7:8">asay sinayil maatame gaddeeza.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Booth ma7o ma77eez gaame woyita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Yeypp guye, zerethi ubbaypp, kaatetitha ubbaypp, kochch ubbayppennee duma duma doona odinttizitaypp zawa baa gaame woya ta be7eeza. Ye asay booth aduss ma7o ma77ii, zambba haye fa kushe aykkii, zufaanay tiinannee Duray tiina eqqeeza. <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>Unttii fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Atotith zufaanayil betteez nu Xoossayppenne Duraypp yi7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Kiitanchchitay ubbay, zufaanayisnnee, cimitayisinnee oydd medhetithitay yuushayir mari eqqeeza. Unttii zufaanay tiina xuggunii Xoossayis goynneeza.<verse eid="REV 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>«Amin77ii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">Anjjo, bonchcho, ecetith, galata, Saaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">wolqqa, minotithii medhinapp medhina hellodayis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">nu Xoossayis maaqqo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amin77ee!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 7:12">yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Cimitaypp pettay taako, «Yha booth ma7a ma77eez asitay oonanttara? Unttii anapp ye7eenee?» yeegii ta oycceeza.<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Taanikka mahii, «Godayyo, ne eriza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Eekka taako, «Yeyititay gaame waaye aadhii ye7eezita. Unttii fa ma7a Duray suuthar meeccii boothii udeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Daan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat. 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar. 13:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Yeyi gishos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">«Unttii Xooss zufaanay tiina yezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">qammannee gallas e keetha eza goynneeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Ma zufaanayil afa betteezay unttis kamppa maaqqoda.<verse eid="REV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/>Yikkepp guye, unttii nayinttaamii, saaminttaamii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">Awa michakka unttan shocaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa. 49:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>Zufaanitay gido betteez Duray unttan heenggoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">De7o pultto haathiko unttan kaalithoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Xoossii u aafaypp afuth ubba uccoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 7:17">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Maz. 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Iziqe. 34:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:2">Maz. 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa. 49:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Laappuntha maatamay dooyintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Duray laappuntha maatama dooyeez wode bagga saate maaqqodana salo cicirkk geeza.<verse eid="REV 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Yeypp guye, taanii laappun tulitulitay inggintteez laappun kiitanchchitay Xooss tiina eqqeezana be7eeza.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Ixaannee cuyshiz worqqa qendele aykkeez hara kiitanchchay yi7ii, yarshsho aqay kalayid eqqeeza. E zufaanay tiina yez worqqa iqayil yarshsho aqayil afa geeshshitayis ubbayis woosara gujjii yarshshod garkk ees gaame ixaannee inggintteeza. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Ixaannee cuyay geeshshitay woosar pettipp kiitanchcha kushepp udee Xoossiko kezeeza. <verse eid="REV 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Yeypp guye, kiitanchchay ixaannee cuyshiz qendela ekkii, ezayid yarshsho aqaypp qaaqa tama kunthi sa7a sulle dhugeeza. Yeypp dada, dada saarth, zeelinthinnee biita eni7o haneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lewii. 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:2">Iziqe. 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kes. 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Wan. Qon. 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappun tulitulita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Yeypp guye, laappun kiitanchchitay aykkeez laappun tultulita puggodayis giigintteeza.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Tiina kiitanchchay fa tulitulo puggin shachchinnee suuthar walakintteez tama maaqqii sa7all wodheeza. Sa7as hayidzii kushepp pettay xuugintteeza; mithapp hayizhi kushepp pettay xuugintteeza; cil7o maata ubbay xuugintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-25">Kes. 9:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Iziqe. 38:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Nam7intho kiitanchchay fa tulitula puggeez wode wolqqama amba aazizibaz tamar eexittar abba olintteeza. Yeyppe, abbaypp hayidzii kushepp pettay suuth maaqqeeza. <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>Abba shemppor yez medhetithitaypp hayidzii kushepp pettay yhayqqeeza; markkabitayppekka hayidzii kushepp pettay dhabeeza.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Hayidzintho kiitanchchay fa tulitulo puggeez wode zhabbe garkk eexiz wolqqama xoolinttay hathitaypp hayidzii kushepp pettayil afannee pulttitayil afa salopp wodhdheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:12">Isa. 14:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Ye xoolinttay sunthay Camo ginttittiza. Haathaypp hayidzii kushepp pettay canggiseeza; haathay canggeez gishos gaame asay ye haatha uzhii yhayqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Erim. 9:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Oyddintho kiitanchchay fa tulitula puggeeza. Awapp, aginappennee xoolinttitaypp hayidzii kushepp pettay shocintteeza; u poo7aypp hayidzii kushepp pettay dhumeeza. Gallasaypp hayidzii kushepp pettay, qammapekka hayidzii kushepp pettay dhumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Iziqe. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Yeypp pettii gollo salol dhoqq gi, piradhdhodar be7eeza. Ye gollay fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Atteez hayidzii kiitanchchitay fa tulitulo puggodayis yez gishos sa7a yez asayiko ayye! Ayye! Ayye!» yeegodar si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Yeypp guye, ichchintha kiitanchchay fa tulitulo puggin salopp sul sa7a pokkeez xoolintta ta be7eeza. Ees wolqqama ciimmo olla dooyiza qulppe inggintteeza. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Ezii ciimmo olla dooyin dalgge tama ollapp keziz cuya garkk cuyay ye ollaypp kezeeza. Ya ollaypp keziz cuyayir awannee salay dhumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Medhe. 19:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>Ye cuyaypp boolitay biital kezeeza. Sa7a yez yhanigaricos yeza wolqqay garkk wolqqa boolitayis inggintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12">Kes. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Xooss maatame sinol baa asay aaddapp attin sa7a yez maata woy mithii woy aba cil7obaz maaqqin qohaamay garkk boolitayis odinntteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Iziqe. 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Boolitay asa ichchin agina hellodayis paxa kaa7oday garkk mawute inggeezaypp attin asa wodhoday garkk baaya. Yhanigarcco as dukkin zaamizay garkk boolitaykka dukkii zaamisiza. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Ye gallasitayid asay yhayiqo koyoda, zin denggena. Unttii yhayqqodayis amottoda, zin yhayiqo unttapp haakkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Iyo. 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Erim. 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Boolitaykka olas giigii betteez para aaziza. Boolitay ommayil worqqa zawude aazizabaz yeza; u aafayraykka as aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:4">Iyu. 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>U binnannay maachch binnannagarkk adusse. U achchaykka gaammo achch aaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Iyu. 1:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>Unttis tiral gaddiza biraata xurure yeza; u qefitay giirthay olas gaallabiza farannee fara gaare giirth garkk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:5">Iyu. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Unttis yhanigarcco goynno aaziz goynonnee dukkiza yiishshii yeza. Ye goynayir ichchin agina asa qohoday garkk wolqqa inggitteeza. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Unttis kaati yeza; ye kaatay ciimmo olla kiitanchcha. E sunthay Ibraysxe doonar Abddoona; ma Girike doonar Apholoona ginttittiza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abddoona guussay dhabisizaya guussii.</char></note><verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Tiina ayyay aadheeza; yikkee, haga hara nam77ii ayyitay yi7iza.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Usuppuntha kiitanchchay fa tulitula puggeeza. Xooss tiina eqqeez, worqqe yarshsho aqo yez oydd kacitaypp pettii giirth ta si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1">Kes. 30:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Ye giirthay tulitula aykkeez usuppuntha kiitanchchayko, «Efiraxiise giz damma haatha accintteeza oydd kiitanchchita bili7oba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Asaypp hayidz kushepp petta wodhoday garkk ye saatayis, ye gallasayis, ye aginayisinnee ye laythayis giigii betteez oyddii kiitanchchitay bili7intteeza. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Ola para toggiza olanchchitay taybay nam77ii xeet miloone maaqqeezana ta si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Ma ta qonccithar paritannee ye parita toggeez asa be7eeza. Ye asay tiral gaddiza biraata xururay tama qaaqa garkk zoqo, yaakintte garkk karith culukkonnee iride aaziz diinnee aaziza. Paritay ommay gaammo ommay garkk; u doonayppekka tama, cuyannee diinnee kezeeza. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Paritay doonaypp kezeez tamayira, cuyayirannee diinnayir ya hayidzii gaditayir sa7a yez asaypp hayizd kushep pettay yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Ya paritay wolqqay u doonayidannee u goynayil yeza. U goynaykka shoosh omma garkk; u yeyir asa qohiza.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Yha gaditayir yhayqqekka atteezitay fa kushe oosaypp maaqqii maarotith gellekkaya. Unttii tuna ayyanasinnee worqqapp, birapp, naase biraatapp shuchchappennee mithapp, oosintteez eeqas goynniza. Be7adayis, si7odayis, yedhdhodayis danda7oowa eeqayis goyinnitha ashshekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4">Maz. 115:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Asay u shemppo wodheezayis, biteezayis, lagiteezayisinnee kastteezayis maarotith gelekkaya.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiitanchchannee xaath maxaafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Yeypp guye, shaara ma77eeza hara mino kiitanchchay salopp sa7a wodhdhodar ta be7eeza. E ommayil afa zuulla yeza. E sinay awa garkke; e tokitay tama tuusitay garkke. <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Ye kiitanchchay dooya yez pettii xiqqa xaath maxafitto fa kusher aykkii, fa ushachcha toke abbal afa, fa haddirssa toka biittal afa esseeza. <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>Xaagiza gaammo garkk fa qaala dhoqq udii uukkeeza. E ukkeez wode laappun daditay fa guumitha sisseeza.<verse eid="REV 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Laappun daditay odintteez wode ta xaafodayis giigintteeza. Zini salopp, «Laappun daditay odintteezana maatamer gorddobap attin xaafippe» yeegiz giirthii ta si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Yeypp guye abbal afannee biittal afa eqqii, ta be7eez kiitanchchay, fa ushachcha kushe salo udee miicceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kes. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:40">Nam7i. 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Daan. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>E miccii salonnee salo yez ubba, sa7annee sa7all yez ubba, abbannee e gancce yez ubba medhdheez medhinas yez Xoossay sunthayir caaqqii, «Yhaypp guye, gam7enna! <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>Zini laappuntha kiitanchchay fa tulitula sisiza wode Xoossii fa aylle maaqqeez nabitay baggar qoncciseez xuura qofay polinttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Yeypp guye, «Abbal afannee biittal afa eqqeezay kiitanchchay kushe dooyinttii yez xaath maxafitto ekkoba» yeegii nam7intho salopp taas ododar ta si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8-3:3">Iziqe. 2:8—3:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Taanii ye kiitanchchayko yhanigii, xiqqa xaath maxafitto inggoba gi oyiceeza. E taako, «Ekkii izo mooba; iza ne ulayid canggoda, zin ne doonayid ees garkk mal7oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Taanii kiitanchchay kushepp ye xiqqa xaath maxafitto ekkii meeza; ta doonayid eess garkk mal7eeza, zin ta meezaypp guye ta ulayid canggeeza. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Yeypp guye, taako, «Neenii gaame kochitayis, woyas, duma duma doonar odinttizitayisinnee kaatitayis tinbbite mahii ododayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Nam77ii markkitta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Yeypp guye, yhadhdhas maadediz gufe inggii, «Yhanigii Xooss karannee yarshsho aqay aapun yhadhdhazako yhadhdhoba; ezayid goynnizitakka payidoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Iziqe. 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Zak. 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Zini Xooss Keeth dirssapp gaxa yezay Ayihude maaqqekka asayis inggintteez gishos yhadhdhekkazar ashshii ashshoba. Ayihude baa asay geeshsha katamtto oytamannee nam77ii aginas yedhdhii haaroda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luq. 21:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>Taanii kayo afila ma77eez ta nam77ii markkitta kiittoda; unttii pettii mukulonnee nam77ii xeetinnee usuppuntam gallas tinbbite ododay garkk ta unttis wolqqa inggoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Ye nam77ii markkitay alame Goday tiina eqqiza nam77ii woyira mithitannee nam77ii xomppe gaddiz kochchita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zak. 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Oonkka unttan qohodayis koyko u doonaypp tama kezii, u morkkita xuugiza. Unttan qohodayis koyeez oonkka yhay garkk hanii yhayqqoda. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>Unttii tinbbite odiza wode ira bukkaamay garkk salo gorddodayis unttis mawute yeza. Ubbarakka haathe suuth laammodayis, maakka u fa koyeezaygarkk biitta duma duma gador dhabisodayis unttis mawute yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Kaat. 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:17">Kes. 7:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Unttii fa markkatitha haaseezaypp guye, ciimmo ollapp kezeez do7ay unttar olinttii unttan gamoda; wodhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Daan. 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5">Wan. Qon. 13:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>U ahay aazisor Soodome woy Gibxxe ginttinttii xeeginttiz gita katama ogayil afa olinttoda. Izakka u Goday mazqalel afa sotintteezano.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa. 1:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Ma zerethi ubbaypp, kochch ubbaypp, duma duma doona odinttizitayppennee kaatetithii ubbaypp ye7eez asay u aha hayidzii gallasinnee bagga hellodayis be7ada. U ahay mooginttaamay garkk asay kayoda. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Yha nam77ii nabitay sa7a yez asa waaytheez gishos asay u yhayiqayid ufaytteeza. Fa ufayssa beezodayis pettay pettayis imota inggeeza.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Hayidzii gallasinnee baggapp guye, shemppo inggiza ayyana Xooss kalepp yi7ii u gancce gelin, unttii denddii eqqeeza. Unttan be7eez ubbay iita yashitteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:10">Iziqe. 37:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Yeypp guye, ye nam77ii nabitay, «Yhana ud salo kezoytta» giz qaala u salopp si7eeza. U morkkitay unttan be7adar, unttii shaara gancce gelii pud salo kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Kaat. 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Ye saatayid biittay wolqqama eni7o eni7in, katamaypp taphphintha kushay dhabeeza. Ma biitta eni7or laappun mukulo asay yhayqqeeza. Atteez asay iita kukkurii yashittii; salo Xoossayis bonchcho inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:12">Wan. Qon. 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Nam7antha ayyay aadheeza, yikkee hayidzintha ayyay eele ye7oda.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappuntha tulitula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Laappuntha kiitanchchay fa tulitula puggeeza. Salopp, «Sa7a kaatetithay nu Godayisinne Ees Kiristtoosas maaqqeeza; E medhinappe medhina hellodayis kawutoda» yeegiz wolqqama giirthitay sintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:18">Kes. 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Daan. 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Yeypp, Xooss tiina, fa zufaanitayil betteez laatamannee oyddii cimitay xuggunii, Xoossis goynnitar,<verse eid="REV 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>«Yhattekka binkka yezayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ubba mooddiz Goda Xoossayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">neenii ne gita wolqqa aykkeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ne kawuteez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">nuunii nena galatiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kes. 3:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>Ayihude baa asay kaccintteeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">zin ne kachchay ye7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Yhayqqeezitayil afa ne pirddiza woday ye7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Neenii ne ayllitayis, nabitayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">geeshshitayisinnee ne sunthayis yashittizitayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">laafitayisinnee gititayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">u oosay garkk inggiza woday helleeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Alame dhabisizita dhabisiza woday ye7eeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 11:18">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:5">Maz. 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:5">110:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:13">115:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>Salo yez Xooss Keethay dooyintteeza; e gancce Xooss caaqo taabotay bentteeza. Ma zeelinthii zeelinggeeza, dadannee dada saarthii guumeeza; biitta eni7eeza; wolqqama shachchii shacceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Wan. Qon. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21">21</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Maachchatinnee dawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Yeypp guye, wolqqama malla salo bentteeza. Awa ma77eez, agina fa toke oommo aatheez, taphpho nam77ii xoolinttita zawude garkk fa ommal gaddeez, pettii asita bentteeza. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Ye asita wolqqa iitazin, izo yelos iqithi aykkin un77inttii uukkeeza.<verse eid="REV 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Ma hara malla salo bentteeza. Laappun ommitaynnee taphphii kacitay yez damigita zoqo dawe bentteeza. E fa ommitayil afa laappun zawude gaddeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Daan. 7:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Ye dawe fa goynayir xoolinttitaypp sikka salopp dafii sa7a oleeza. Ye daway asita na7a yelii oleezan garkk maadayis koyii, yelos iqinttiz asttii tiina eqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Daan. 8:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/>Ye astta kaatetitha ubba biraata gufer haarodayis yez dhiirath na7a yeleeza. Na7ay Xoossikonnee e zufaanayiko udee ekintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Isa. 66:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Maz. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Asita pettii mukulonnee nam77ii xeetannee usuppuntam gallas hellodayis izo naagoday garkk Xoossii iis giigisii gaddeez aqa liizho gade qosintto qiteeza.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Salo ola medhintteeza. Mika7eelennee E kiitanchchitay dawayira olintteeza; dawayinnee e kiitanchchitaykka mahii olintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Daan. 10:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Zini dawaynnee e kiitanchchitay gamintteeza, yeypp salo unttis aqo dhabeeza. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>Damma dawe, binii shooshay, sa7a dhugintteeza. Eekka Daabuloosa woy Xalahe ginttinttiz alama balithizaya. Eza e kiitanchchitayira pettipp sul oleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Medhe. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:18">Luq. 10:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Yeypp guye, salopp yhay garkk yeegiz giirth ta si7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">«Yhatti atotith, wolqqannee kaatetithay, nu Xoossayis maaqqeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">mawute Kiristtoosas maaqqeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Yikkee, qammannee gallas Xooss tiina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nu ishita mootizay salopp sul dhugintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:9">Iyo. 1:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Unttii duray suuthaayirannee fa markkatith qaalayir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">eza gameeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Unttii fa shemppos qadhinttekkazar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">fana yhayiqos aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Yeyi gishos, salonnee e gancce yezitayo ufayttoytta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">Zini biittannee abba ayye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Yikkee, daabuloosa faasa xiqqa wode atteezana ereez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">wolqqama kachchar yinttiko wodhdheeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 12:12">yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Daway fana sa7a oleezana be7eez wode dhiirathi na7a yeleez Asito bayi7itheeza. <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>Asito shooshay qohaamay garkk liizho gadha iis giigintteeza aqo piradhdhi yhammaday garkk nam77ii wolqqama gollo qefe aazizay iis inggitteeza. Ezayid shooshay tiinaypp haakkii hayidzii laythinnee bagga bonchchor naaginttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Daan. 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Shooshay ye asito di7o ekkii qitoday garkk daway borkka haath garkk fa doonaypp asitii guyer coozh gogiseeza. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Zini biittay asito maaddeeza; biittay fa doona dooyii daway doonaypp kezeez haatha mixaxeeza. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Ye daway asittil afa iita shenttii, I zerithita, Xooss kiita naagizitannee Yesuusas ammanintteez markkita olodayis yhanigeeza. <verse eid="REV 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18"/>Daway abba lanqqe yez shafel eqqeeza.<verse eid="REV 12:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nam77ii do7ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Yeypp guye, pettii do7ay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grike maxaafepp baggitay e eqqeeza ma baggitay ta eqqeeza giza</char></note> abbapp kezodar ta be7eeza. Ees taphphii kacitayinnee laappun ommitay yeza. Ye taphphii kacitayil afa taphphii zawuditay yeza. Ye ommitayil afa cashsh sunthitay yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3">Daan. 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:3">Wan. Qon. 17:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Ta be7eez do7ay maahe aaziza; e tokay banbarqqe toke garkke; e doonaykka gaammo doona aaziza. Daway fa wolqqa, fa zufaanannee fa gita mawuta ye do7ayis inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:4">Daan. 7:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>Ye do7ay ommaypp pettayil afa yhayiqos helthiz madoth ta be7eeza, zin ye madothay paxeeza. Alamay ubbay malabaz gi ye do7a kaalleeza. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Daway fa mawuta do7ayis inggeez gishos asii ubbay dawa goynneeza. Ma asay, «Do7ana aazizay oonoo? Ezar olinttodayis danda7izay oonoo?» yeegttar do7ayis goynneeza.<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>Ye do7ayis utirttoday garkkennee cazhoday garkk doona ees inggintteeza; oytamanne nam77ii agina haaroday garkk mawute ees inggintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Daan. 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>Ye do7ay Xoossa, Xooss suntha, E yez aqanne salo yez bazita cazhith aykkeeza. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>Ye do7ay geeshshitayra olinttii, unttan gamoday garkk wolqqa ees inggintteeza. Koch ubbayil, gade ubbayil, duma duma doona odinttiza ubbayllannee zerethi ubbayil mawute ees inggintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Daan. 7:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Alame medhintteezaypp aykkii, shukintteez Durayir de7o maxaafayid u sunthitay xaafinttekka yha sa7a yez as ubbay ye do7ayis goynnoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Maz. 69:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>Si7iz haye yez asii si7o. <verse eid="REV 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/>Oonkka di7inttodayis yezay di7inttiza. Mashshar yhayqqodayis yezay mashshar yhayqqoda. Geeshshitay garzhaynnee ammanay ye wode erinttoday.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Erim. 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:11">43:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>Maakka, hara do7a sa7app kezodar ta be7eeza. Ees dur kace aaziza nam77ii kacitay yeza; e nashaykka daweesay garkke. <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>Ye do7ay tiina do7ay mawutayir ubba baz e tiina oothiza. Eekka yhayiqos helthiz madothap paxeez tiina do7ayis; biitta yez as ubbay goynnoday garkk udiza. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>Ye nam7antho do7ay hara attozin, tama salopp as ubbitay tiina wothod hellodayis gita malabazita ootheeza. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Tiina do7ay tiinayid oothoday garkk, ees inggintteez mala bazar sa7a yez as ubba E balitheeza. Mashshar madothii paxeez do7ayis bonchcho misile giigisoday garkk iital eez asa azazeeza. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Nam7intho do7ay tiina do7ay misilayis shemppo inggintteeza. Mawute ingintteezay odinttoday garkkennee ees goynnoozitay yhayqqod garkk oothiza mawute ees inggitteeza.<verse eid="REV 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Ye nam7intho do7ay xiqqitayinnee damitay, manqqitaynnee duritay, goditaynnee ayllitay fa ushachch kushel woy fa sinol malla gaddoday garkk ciiphicheeza. <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>Ye do7a suntha beeziza malla woy e suntha payiday baa as oonkka bayizodayisnnee woonggodayis danda7oowa.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Ecetithii koshshizay yeydda. Kahar yez ookka ye do7ay payida ero; ye taybay mallizay ase. Ye taybay usuppun xeetinnee usuppun tamannee usuppun.<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Durannee xeetannee oyttamannee oyddii mukulo asita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Yeypp guye, Duray Xiyone ambal afa eqqeezana ta be7eeza. E sunthannee e Aday sunthay u sinayid xaafintteez, xeetannee oyttamannee oyddii mukulo asitay ezar yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Iziqe. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:3">Wan. Qon. 7:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Salopp gita soossa haath guumithinnee dada guumth aaziz wolqqama giirth ta si7eeza. Ma ta si7eez giirthay diithi diixodar si7inttiz giirth garkke. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Xeetannee oyttamannee oyddii mukulo asitay zufaanayi tiina, oyddii shemppor yez medhetithitay tiinannee cimitay tiina eqqii biitapp wozintteezitaypp hara oonkka tamaarodayis danda7oowa oroth mazmuure yexxeeza. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Yeyititay maachchar fana tunisekka naageez geeshshita. Unttii duray yhanigiza aqo ubba kaaliza. Unttii Xoossisinnee Durayis as ubbay ganccepp bayra maaqqaday garkk wozinttii shiiqeezita. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>Unttii worddonnee boro baa asita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Sopo. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hayidzii kiitanchchita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Yeypp guye, medhina Wonggile sa7all afa yez kaatetith ubbayis, koch ubbayis, yara ubbayisnnee duma duma doona odinttiza ubbayis markkattodayis salora piradhdhiza hara kiitanchcho ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Ye kiitanchchay fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Xoossii alama pirddiza saatay helleeza, Xoossayis yashittooytta; eza bonchchoytta. Salonnee sa7a, abbannee pultto haatha medhdheez Xoossayis goynnoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Hara nam7intho kiitanchchay, «Woyita ubba mathisiz lagite woyne ushsheezan, gita Baabiloone pokkeeza! pokkeeza!» yeegii ukkittar tiina kiitanchcha kaalleeza.<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Hayidzintha kiitanchchay unttan kaallii, fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Do7ayisnnee e misilayis goynnizay woy e malla fa sinol woy fa kushel gaddeez ubbay, <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>Xooss kachchii woyna u uzhoda yeykka woynaykk walakinttekka e kachch xuu7ayir aadda duqintteezaya. Unttii geeshsha kiitanchchitay tiinannee Duray tiina eexiza diinnee tama gancce fath kaa7inttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa. 51:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe. 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Iziqe. 38:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/>Unttii waayinttiza tamaypp keziz cuyar medhdhii medhinas cuyittar yezoda. Do7annee e misila goynnizannee ma ye do7ay suntha mallay yez oonkka qammannee gallas shemppo bayth kaa7inttoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa. 34:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Xooss azaza naagizayinnee Yesuusas ammanintteezitay garzheez minotithay qonccoday yeydda.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Salopp yhay garkk yeegiz giirthi ta si7eeza. «Yhaya xaafoba, Yikkepp guye Godayir yezii yhayqqizitayi anjjintteezita» yeegiz giirth salopp ta si7eeza. Ayyanay, «Ee tuma, u oosay unttan kaalliza gishos unttii fa daaburaypp shemppoda» yeegiza.<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday kachchii biital</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Yeypp guye, booth shaara bentteeza. Yha shaarayil afa betteez As Na7a aazizana ta be7eeza. E fa ommayil afa worqqa zawude gaddeeza; fa kushayidakka oco baaca aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13-14">Daan. 7:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Hara kiitanchchay Xooss keethaypp kezii, shaaral afa betteezayko fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Katha shiisho torchche helleez gishos ne baaca dakkii katha buucoba; sa7a yez katha buuciz wode helleeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Iyu. 3:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Yeyppe shaaral afa betteezay fa baaca sa7a dakkii, sa7a yez katha bucceeza.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Maakka salo yez Xooss keethaypp hara kiitanchchay kezeeza; eesikka oco baaca yeza.<verse eid="REV 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Tamal afa mawute yez hara kiitanchchay yarshsho aqay kalaypp kezeeza. E fa qaala dhoqq udii oco baaca aykkeez kiitanchchayko, «Woyne aafay teereez gishos ne oco baaca dakkii, sa7a yez woynay koosha gachchii shiishoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Ye kiitanchchay fa baaca dakkii, sa7a yez woynaypp koosha gachchii, Xooss gita kachch buulliz aqo oleeza. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Unttii Katamaypp gaxa yez woyne aafe buulliz aqo buuleeza. Suuthii woyne buulliz aqaypp kezii hayidzii xeet kilo mitire garkk haakkii, fara puulo helizay garkk eelli dhoqqii geeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa. 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:15">Erim. 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Wan. Qon. 19:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith boshita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Taanii salol hara dammannee pala malabaz be7eeza. Xooss wurssitha kachch poliza laappun boshita aykkeez laappun kiitanchchita ta be7eeza.<verse eid="REV 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Yeypp guye tamar walakintteez burccuko abba aaziza baz ta be7eeza. Ye abbay gaxa do7a, e misilannee e sunthay tayba gameezita ta be7eeza. Xoossii unttis inggeez diitha aykkii burcuko abbal eqqeeza. <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Unttii Xooss aylle Muse mazmurannee Duray mazmuura yhay garkk yeegii yexxeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">«Godayyo, Ubbapp Wolqqama Xoossayyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">ne oosay dammannee malabazii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Woya ubbayis kaatayyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">ne ogay xillonnee tuma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Kes. 15:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Geeshshii ne aadda maaqqeez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Godayyo, nees yashittoozayinnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ne suntha bonchchoozay oonoo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ne xillo oosay as ubbayis qoncce maaqqeez gishos woya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ubbay ne tiina yi7ii goynnoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 15:4">yeegii yexiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:7">Erim. 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Maz. 86:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Yeypp guye, salo dooyinttii yez Markkatith Dunkkaane maaqqeez Xooss Keetha ta be7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:21">Kes. 38:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Laappun boshita aykkeez laappun kiitanchchitay Xooss keethaypp kezeeza. Unttii geeshshinnee pociz liino ma7o ma77eeza; fa tiral worqqe dancco dancceeza. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Oyddii medhetithitaypp pettay, medhinas yez Xooss kachchii kumeez laappun worqqa xuu7ita laappun kiitanchchitayis inggeeza. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Xooss bonchchayppennee e wolqqaypp denddeezayid Xooss Keethay cuyar kumeeza. Laappun kiitanchchitay aykkeez laappun boshitay polinttod hellodayis Xooss Kara oonkka gelodayis danda7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Kes. 40:34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10">1 Kaat. 8:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss kachchii kumeez xuu7ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Yeypp guye, laappun kiitanchchitayko, «Yhanigii Xooss kachch aykkeez laappun xuu7ita sa7al laaloytta» yeegii, wolqqama giirth Xooss keethapp keessadar ta si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Tiina kiitanchchay yhanigii, xuu7ana sa7a laalin, do7ay mallay yezitayilannee e misilayis goynnizitayill iitannee zaamiz madothii kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:10">Kes. 9:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Nam7intha kiitanchchay xuu7ana abbal laalin, abbay yhayqqeez as suuth maaqqeeza. Ma abba gancce yez shemppor yez medheteth ubbay yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Hayidzintha kiitanchchay xuu7ana dama haathalannee pultto haathal laalin, haathitaykka suuthii maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17">Kes. 7:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Yeypp guye, haathal afa mawute yez kiitanchchay yhay garkk yeegodar ta si7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">«Yhattekka binikka yez geeshsh Godayyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kes. 3:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yhay garkk ne pirddeez gishos neenii geeshshii.<verse eid="REV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>Unttii geeshshitay suuthinnee nabitay suuth laaleez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">unttan suuth ushsheeza yeykk unttis beeziza baz»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 16:6">yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Yarshsho aqaypp,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">«Ee Godayyo, Ubbapp Wolqqama Xoossayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">ne pirdday tumannee xillo»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 16:7">yeegiza qaala si7eeza.<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Oyddantha kiitanchchay xuu7a awal afa laalin, awa fa mishayir asa xuuggoday garkk awas wolqqa inggintteeza. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Asay wolqqama mishayir xuuginttii, ye boshitayil afa mawute yez Xooss suntha cazheeza; maarotith gelekkaya, Xoossankka bonchchekkaya.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Ichchintha kiitanchchay xuu7ana do7ay zufaanayil afa laalin, ye do7ay kaatetithay dhumeeza. Asaykka un77aypp dendeezayid fa inxarssa coonggiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21">Kes. 10:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>Ma asay un77ay gishonnee madothay gishos salo Xoossa baaddeeza; fa ootheez nagarayppekka maaqqekkaya.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Usuppuntha kiitanchchay xuu7ana gita Efiraxiise haathal laalin, awa kess baggapp ye7od kaatitayis oge giigoday garkk haathay meleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:15">Isa. 11:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Yeypp guye, daway doonaypp, do7ay doonayppennee worddo nabe doonaypp oqane aaziza hayidzii tuna ayyanitay kezodar ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Unttii malabazita oothiz tuna ayyanita. Ye hayidzii tuna ayyanitay Ubbapp Wolqqama Xooss gita gallas hanodayis yez olayis asa shiishodayis alame kaat ubbayiko yhanigoda.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>«Yikkee, taanii kayizo garkk ye7oda! As tiina kallo maaqqii fa kallotithayis yeellataamay garkk barkkii, fa ma7a naagiza athay anjjintteezaya!» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Ye tuna ayyanitay kaatitana Ibraysxe doonar Armmagedoone giz aqo shiisheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Kaat. 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Zak. 12:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Laappuntha kiitanchchay xuu7ana carkkol afa laalin, Xooss kara yez zufaanaypp, «Polintteeza» yeegiz wolqqama girithii kezeeza. <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Yeypp zeelinthii zeelinggeeza; daday saarii dhuqqeez, biittay eni7eeza. Yey garkk wolqqama biita eni7o asii medhintteezaypp aykkii yesha eni7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Wan. Qon. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:13">11:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Damma katamita hayidzi kezii shaakintteeza; Gade ubbayid yez katamitay laalintteeza. Xooss gita katama Baabiloone qoppii, fa iita kachchii woyne ushshii kumeez xuu7ana iis inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa. 51:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>Haathar marintteez biittitay dhabeeza; ambitaykka benttekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:14">Wan. Qon. 6:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Asayil afa oytamannee ichchin kilo giraame garkk deexiza wolqqama shachchii salopp bukkeeza. Boshay usa iita maaqqeez gishos asay shachchay boshay gishos Xoossana cazheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Kes. 9:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Laammor erintteez asito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Laappun xuu7ita aykkeez laappun kiitanchchitaypp pettay taako yi7ii, «Yhana Ye7oba; gaame haathitayil afa betteez gita laammiza asttil afa ye7odayis yez pirdda ta nena beessada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:13">Erim. 51:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>Alame kaatitay iir laammeeza; alamel yez asaykka I laametith woyina uzhii matheeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Erim. 51:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>Ye kiitanchchay tana ayyanar liizho gadha kanggeeza. Ezayid pettii asita cashsh sunthay ezal afa xaafintteeza, laappun ommannee taphphii kace yez zoqo do7a toggeez pettii asito be7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Wan. Qon. 13:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Ye asita kaaloose ma7onnee zoqo ma7o ma77eeza; iza worqqar, bonchcho shuchcharannee inqo giz al7o shuchchar buqurintteeza. Iza fa kushayid borssizabazinnee laametith tunatithar kumeez worqqe xuu7a aykkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Erim. 51:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>I sinayil afa yez xuura sunthay, «Damma Baabiloone, laamosinnee sa7a yez tuna baz ubbayis indo» yeegiz xuufe xaafinttii betteeza. <verse eid="REV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Ma ye maachchat geeshshitay suuthannee Yesuusas markkattittar yhayqqeezitay suuth uzhii matheezanno ta bi7ii yhay malabaz geeza.<verse eid="REV 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Kiitanchchay taako, «Neenii abis malabaz gee? Taanii nees ye asitii xuurannee iza tookkeez laappun ommannee taphphii kace yez do7ay xuura ododa. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Neenii be7eez do7ay binii yeza, zin yhatti baaya. Guyepp ye do7ay ciimmo ollapp kezoda, dhaboko yhammada. Alamay medhintteezaypp aykkii, de7o maxaafayid u sunthay xaafinttekka sa7a yez asay do7ana bi7ii malabaz goda. Abis giiko, ya do7ay kase yeza; yhatti baaya, zin tiinapp ye7od.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Daan. 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">Wan. Qon. 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Maz. 69:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>«Ecetithar yez kaha koshshizay yhaydda. Laappun ommitay asitay bettiz laappun ambita; yeyititay ma laappun kaatita. <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>Unttapp ichchin kaatitay pokkeeza. Pettay yhanno hellodayis haariza; yhankko Kaatay ye7ekka. E xiqqa wodes aadda katam7i ye7odayis beeziza. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Kase yeza do7ay, yhatti baazay, E fa ommas hosppuntha do7a. E laappun do7itaypp petta; E dhaboko yhanigiza.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>«Neenii be7eez taphphii kacitay haga haaro aykkekka taaphii kaatita. Zini unttii do7ayira pettii saate kawutii haarodayis unttis mawute ingginttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:24">Daan. 7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Unttis ubbayis pettii qofa yeza; unttii fa wolqqannee fa mawuta do7ayis inggoda. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>Unttii Durayir olinttoda, zin duray goditay Godanne kaatitay Kaat maaqqeez gishos Eer yez E xeegeezitay, dooreezitaynnee ammanintteezitay ye kaatita gamoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Kiitanchchay maakka taako, «Laammizana betteez ye neenii be7eez haathitay kochchita, kaatetethita, zerethitannee duma duma doonar odinttizita. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>Ma neenii be7eez taphphii kacennee do7ay laammiza asito ixxoda. Unttii iis yez ubba baz ekkoda. Ma izo kallo ashshodanne I asho maada; yeypp unttii izo tamar xuuggoda. <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>Yikkee, Xooss qaalay polinttod hellodayis u qofay petto maaqqoday garkk unttii fa aqisiza wolqqa do7ayis inggodannee Xoossii qoppeeza unttii oothoday garkk u wozinayid Xooss amo gaddeeza. <verse eid="REV 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>Ye neenii be7eez asita sa7a kaatita haariza gita katamito» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone dhabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Yeypp guye, gita mawuter yez hara kiitanchchay salopp wodhdhodar ta be7eeza. Ye kiitanchchay bonchchay sa7a poo7iseeza. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>Fa qaala dhoqq udii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">«Damma Baabiloone dhabeeza! E dhabeeza!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Baabiloone Gaalenes aqiza aqo maaqqeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">Duma duma tuna ayyaanitayis keethe maaqqeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">tunannee fiilintteez kafitay shemppiza aqo maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa. 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">Erim. 51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Wan. Qon. 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa. 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:39">Erim. 50:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>As zerethi ubba fa laame woyna ushsheeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Sa7a kaatitay iir laammeeza. Iis yez aqopp aadheez duretithaypp denddeezayid</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">biittal yez zal7izitay duretteeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:3">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Erim. 51:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Yeypp guye, ta salopp yhay garkk yeegiz hara girisii si7eeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">«Ta woyitayo I nagara iir koxaamay garkkennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">iza ekkodayis yez seera yi ekkaamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">iippe kezoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Erim. 51:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>Yikkee, I nagaray salo hellodayis doorintteeza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Xoossii I naaqa qoppeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Medhe. 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>Iza inggeezan garkk mahii iis inggoytta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Iza ootheez oosayis nam77ii kushe iis mahoytta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Iza walakkeez ushshayil afa yi nam77ii kushe walakintteez ushsh I xuu7ayid kunthoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Maz. 137:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Erim. 50:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Iza bonchchintteezannee iis giigeezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">iis metonnee kayo inggoytta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Iza fa wozinayir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‹Taanii kaatat garkk betteeza; ta azin baa maachch baaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">taanii ubbarakka kayakka yesha taan be7aamii› yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Yeyi gishos, bosha ubbay, yhayqqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">hargge, kayannee naye izo pettii gallas aykkoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Ma iza tamar xuuginttoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">abis giiko, izil afa pirddiza Goda Xoossay wolqqama»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:8">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Isa. 47:7-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>«Iir laameezitaysinnee i giigayid yezeez, alame kaatitay ye katamita xuuginttin kezeez cuya be7eez wode iis uukkii yeekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16-17">Iziqe. 26:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/>Unttii ye katamit waaye bi7ii yashitteez gishos haakkii eqqii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">«‹Yha gita katamite! Wolqqama katamite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Baabiloone, nena ayye! Ayye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Neenii pettii saate gancce ne pirdda ekkeeza› yeegoda.<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>«U markkabe caana yikkepp woonggiza as baazay gishos sa7a yez zal7anchchitay ye katamitis waassiza kayottiza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Iziqe. 27:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>u markabayid caanintteezaykka worqqe, bira, bonchcho shuchchi, inqo giz al7o shuchchi, lee7o ma7o, culko ma7o, liino ma7o, harre ma7o, zoqo ma7o, duma duma sawuza mithii, zaale achapp, al7o mithapp, naase biraatapp, goole shuchchapp oothintteeaz miisha ubba,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12-13">Iziqe. 27:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>qarafa, sawo, ixaannee, karbbe, shitto, woyne, zayite, liiqo dhiille, gistte, mehe, dure, para, para gaare, ayllitannee hara asita.<verse eid="REV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>«Zal7anchchitay asitiko, ‹Neenii amotteez lo77o baz ubbay neepp dhabeeza. Ne shalayinnee buquritay ubbay neepp haakkeeza. Neenii mahii unttan yesha denggaamii› yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/>Yeyitita zal7ii duretteez zal7anchchitay i meta yashittii iipp haakkii eqqoda. Unttii yeekkodannee kayattoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Iziqe. 27:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>Ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">«‹Liino ma7o, lee7o ma7onnee zoqo ma7o ma77ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">worqqar, bonchcho shuchcharannee inqo giz al7o shuchchar buqurintteeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">ye gita katamita ayye! Ayye!<verse eid="REV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Yhay garkk gita shalo ubbay pettii saater dhabeeza› yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">«Markkabe laaggizitay ubbay, markkaber yhanigizitay ubbay, markkabel afa oothiza ubbaynnee abbal zal7iza ubbay haakkii eqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:14">Isa. 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:26">Iziqe. 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>Ye katamita xuuginttin kezeez cuya be7eez wode ‹Yha wolqqama katamito aaziza hara katama yeneshsha?› yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:32">Iziqe. 27:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>Unttii fa ommal buli7a qoli, yeekeezannee kayatteeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">«‹Abbal afa markkabitay yez ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">I shalayid duretteez ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">ye katamita pettii saate dhabeez gishos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Izo ayye! Izo Ayye!<verse eid="REV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>Salo, I dhabayid ufayttoba!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Geeshshitayo, hawaaritayo, nabitayyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Xoossii yi gishos Iil afa pirddeez gishos ufayttoytta›»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:20">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30">Iziqe. 27:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nam7i. 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:48">Erim. 51:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Yeypp guye, pettii mino kiitanchchay woxa aaziza gita shuchch denthii abba gancce dhogittar, «Damma katamita Baabiloone wolqqar urqqinttii yhay garkk pokkoda; iza yhayinopp guye ubbarakka benttaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:63">Erim. 51:63</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>Diithi diixizitayinnee yexizitayi, shulishulonnee tulitula puggizitay, yikkepp guye ne gancce ubbarakka si7inttaamii. Ab kushe hillar oothiza asikka ne gancce benttenna. Woxa girssi yikkepp guye ne gancce si7inttaam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:8">Isa. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:13">Iziqe. 26:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Xomppe poo7o yhaypp guye ne gancce poo7enna. Machcho ekkizaynnee azin gelizitay girssay yikkepp guye ne gancce si7inttaam. Ne zal7anchchitay biitta ubbayil erintteez wolqqamita. Ne biittayir woya ubba balitheeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>Nabitay suuth, geeshshitay suuthinnee biittal shukintteez as ubba suuth I gancce bentteez gishos Baabiloone pirddintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:49">Erim. 51:49</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Yeypp guye, yhay garkk yeegiz woya giirth garkk yez wolqqama ooshithar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">«Hale luuya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">Paxotithinnee bonchcho wolqqaykka nu Xoossayis maaqqo.<verse eid="REV 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/>E pirdday tumannee luulo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">Biitta fa iita laamer tuniseezanno Xoossii pirddeeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Xoossii fa ayllitay suuth iippe ekkeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:2">yeegodar ta si7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nam7i. 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:7">2 Kaat. 9:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>Ye asay mahii fa qaala dhoqq udii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">«Hale luuya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">Ye katamita medhinas pud afa cuyittar yezoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:3">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa. 34:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Laatamannee oydd cimitayinnee shempor yez oydd medhetithitay zufaanayil betteez Xoossayis xuggunii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">«Amin77ii! Hale luuya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:4">yeegii goynneeza.<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Yeypp guye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">«Xooss ayllitay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">Xoosse yashittiz xiqqitayinnee dammitay ubbay, nu Xoossay galatintto»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:5">yeegiz giirithay zufaanaypp kezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:13">Maz. 115:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Yeypp guye, gaame as garkk awukiz, wolqqama gogiz damma haath guumithinnee dada saarth garkk giirthay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">«Hale luuya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">nu Goday, Ubba danda7iza Xoossay kawuteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Iziqe. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:1">Maz. 93:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:1">97:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Duray bossay helleez gishonnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">eza gelizana giigeez maaqqeez gishos yhana ye7oytta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">wola ufayttoda, galatodannee Eza bonchchoda.<verse eid="REV 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Pocizannee geesh maaqqeez lee7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">ma7o ma77oday garkk iis inggintteeza».</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(Lee7o ma7ay geeshshitay geesh oosayis aaziso.)<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Yeypp guye, kiitanchchay taako, «Duray bossay munethayis xeegintteezitay anjjintteezita» gi xaafoba. Ye kiitanchchay gujjii, «Yhay Xooss tuma qaala» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:2">Mat. 22:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Ye wode ta ezis gonnodayis e tokel afa guphinggeeza. Zini E, «Yeya oothippe! Taanii Yesuusa bagga markkattiz negarkkennee ne ishitay garkke; Xoossis goynnoba yeegeeza. Yikkee, Yesuusabaz markkatteezayis nabeteth ayyana taako» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Booth para toggeezaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Yeypp guye, salo dooyinttin, ezayid booth para yezana ta be7eeza. Ye para toggeezay Ammanintteezannee Tumanchcho ginttinttizaya. E xillotithar pirddizannee olinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:1">Iziqe. 1:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>E aafay tama lath aaziza; e ommayil gaame zawuditay yeza. Eep attin hara oonkka eroowa eel xaafintteez sunthi yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Daan. 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>E suuthar muukintteez ma7o ma77eeza; e sunthaykka Xooss Qaala. <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Boothinnee geeshshi liino ma7o ma77eez salo olanchchitay booth parita toggii e gedeno kaaliza. <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Woyita gachchiza oco mashsha e doonaypp keziza. E biraata gufera asa haaroda. Ubbapp Wolqqama Xooss kachch woyne ushsha buulliz aqa E yedhdhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Maz. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa. 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Iyu. 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:20">Wan. Qon. 14:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>E ma7ayil afannee e wodirayil afa, «Kaatitay Kaatinnee goditay Goda» yeegiz sunthay xaafintteeza.<verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Yeypp guye, awal afa eqqeez pettii kiitanchchana ta be7eeza. Ye kiitanchchay salora piradhdhiza kafo ubbayis fa qaala dhoqq udii, «Yhana ye7oytta! Xooss sibire maadayis pettii aqo shiiqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Iziqe. 39:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>Kaatitay asho, shalaqitay asho, wotaaddaritay asho, paritay asho, parita toggizitay asho, as ubbay asho, ayllitay asho, womaannitay asho, gititaynnee xiqqitay yha ubbitay asha moytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Yhay garkkekka Do7ay, para toggeezitayrannee e olanchchitayira olinttodayis sa7a kaatitaynnee u olanchchitay pettii aqo shiiqeezazin ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Zini ye do7ay aykintteeza e sunthayir malabaz ootheez worddo nabay ezar pettipp aykintteeza. E tiinayid malabaz oothizitay do7ay mallay yezitannee e misila goynnizita E balitheeza. Do7annee worddo nabay nam7aykka diinnee eexiz tama abbayid path olintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1-18">Wan. Qon. 13:1-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Atteezitay booha para toggeezay doonaypp kezeez mashshayir yhayqqeeza. Kafitay ubbay u asha mi kaalleeza.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Mukulo laythi kaatetith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Yeypp guye Zawa baa ciimmo ollay qulppennee gita santhalate fa kushe aykkeez pettii kiitanchchay salopp wodhdhodar ta be7eeza. <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>E dawana aykkii mukulo laythis acceeza. Ye daway Daabuloosa woy Xalahe ginttinttiz binii shoosha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Medhe. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>Kiitanchchay zawa baa ciimmo olla eza olii, mukulo laythi wurod hellodayis kaatetithita mahii balithaamay garkk qulpper gorddii maatamer attameeza. Yeypp guye, daway xiqqa wodes bilinttodayis beeziza.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Yeypp guye, zufaanitannee zufaanitayil afa bettii pirddoday garkk mawute inggintteezana ta be7eeza. Yesuusas markkatteez gishonnee Xooss qaala odeez gishos fa qoodha gachintteez asay shemppa ta be7eeza. Unttii do7a woy do7a misilayis goynnekkaya. Unttii do7ay malla fa sinayid woy fa kushel gaddekkaya. Unttii yhayiqopp denddii Kiristtoosar pettipp mukulo laythi kawuteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Daan. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>Atteez yhankko yhayqqeezitay mukulo laythay wuroda hellodayis yhayiqopp denddekkaya, Yhaykka tiina denddo. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>Tiina yhayiqopp dendda dendizitay anjjetteezitannee geeshshita. Unttal afa nam7intho yhayiqos mawute baaya. Unttii Xoossisinnee Kiristtoosas qeese maaqqoda; ezar pettipp mukulo laythi kawutoda.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xalahe gammintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Mukulo laythay wureezaypp guye Xalahe achchapp bilinttoda. <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>E alame oyddii gonttitayid yez woytta, unttikka Googenne Maagoge ginttinttizita balethii olas shiishodayis kezoda. U taybay abba gaxa yez shafe garkk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Iziqe. 38:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>Unttii biitta ubbayil laalinttii, geeshshitay heerannee Xooss dosiza katamito mareeza. Zini tama salopp wodhdhii unttan meeza.<verse eid="REV 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Unttan balitheez daabuloosa, do7ayinnee worddo nabay wodhdheez eexiz diinnee tama abba unttan oleeza. Unttii qammannee gallas medhinas paxa kaa7inttoda.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith pirdda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Yeypp guye, gita booth zufaanannee zufaanayil afa betteezana ta be7eeza. Sa7annee salo e tiinapp betteeza; zin unttis qointtodayis aqo benttekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Daan. 7:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Yhayqqeez, damitaynnee xiqqitay zufaanay tiina eqqeezana ta be7eeza; maxaafitay dooyintteeza; ma hara de7o maxaafaykka dooyintteeza. Yhayqqeezitay maxaafayid xaafintteez fa oosay garkk pirdda ekkeeza. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Abbay fa gancce yez yhayqqeezita inggeeza; yhayiqonnee Si7oole fa gancce yez yhayqqeezita inggeeza. Pettii pettii as fa oosay garkk pirdda ekkeeza. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Yhayiqonnee Si7oole tama abba olintteeza. Ye tama abbay nam7intho yhayiqo. <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>De7o maxaafayid sunthay xaafinttekka oonkka tama abba wodheeza.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Oroth salonnee oroth sa7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Yhaypp guye oroth salonnee oroth sa7a ta be7eeza. Tiina salaynnee tiina sa7ay dhabeeza; abbaykka yhaypp guye yezaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa. 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Phix. 3:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Geeshsha katamita, oroth Yerusalaame, azin gelodayis buqurinttii giigii yez maachch garkk salo Xooss kalepp sul wodhdhodar ta be7eeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa. 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">Wan. Qon. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">Isa. 61:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Yey garkkekka Zufaanaypp yhay garkk yeegii, odiza gita qaala ta si7eeza; «Xooss Keethay asay gancce yeza; E unttarakk yessada. Unttii e woya maaqqoda; Xoossii fa ommas unttara yessada; E u Xoossa maaqqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Iziqe. 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:11">Lewii. 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>Xoossii u aafaypp afuth ubba uccoda. Binii wogay aadheez gishos yhayiqo, kaya, uufonnee waaye baaya» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa. 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Zufaanel afa betteezay, «Taanii ubba baz orothi udoda» yeegeeza. Maakka taako, «Taanii odizay ammanthizannee tuma maaqqeez gishos xaafoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>Yeypp guye, «Polintteeza! Taanii Alfannee Oomega; Dendonnee wurisithi. Saamintteez ooskka de7o haath pulttaypp cigisekkazar cere immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/>Gamiz oonkka yeya ubba laattoda; taanii ees Xooss maaqqada; eekka ta na7a maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:26">Maz. 89:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>Zini yashshittizitay, ammanoozitay, tunitay, shemppo wodheezitay, laammizitay, bitizitay, eeqa goynnizittaynnee worddotizitay anjjay diinnee eexiz tama abba maaqqoda. Yeykka nam7intho yhayiqo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oroth Yerusalaame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>Laappun wurssitha boshitay kumeez laappun xuu7ita aykkeez laappun kiitanchchitaypp pettay taako yi7ii, «Yhankka ye7oba, taanii nena Durayis machcho maaqqeez wudirtto beezoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Ayyanar tana adussinnee dhoqq amba xeeral afa kessii, geeshsha katama, Yerusalaame, salopp Xooss kalepp sulle wodhdhodar beezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:1">Iziqe. 40:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Ye katamita Xooss bonchchor poo7iza. Ye katamitii poo7o yasphphiide giz al7o shuchch garkk; geeshsh birille garkk phociza. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Ye katamitii gimbbe gassay wolqqamanne adusse. Iis taphpho nam7i pengennee ye pengita naagiza taphpho nam77ii kiitanchchitay yeza. Pengitayil afa taphpho nam77ii Isreele zerethitay sunthitay xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Iziqe. 48:30-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Awa kessii baggar hayidzii pengitay, pude baggar hayidzii pengitay, sulle baggar hayidzii pengennee awa gelo baggar hayidzii pengitay yeza. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Katamitii gimbbe gassay taphpho nam77ii baasitayil afa eqqeeza. Unttal afa taphpho nam77ii Dure hawaaritay sunthay xaafintteeza.<verse eid="REV 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Taas odiza kiitanchchayis, katamito, i pengitannee gimbbe gase yuusha yhadhdhiza worqqa gufe yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Iziqe. 40:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Katamita oyddii mayizanitay yeza; katamati adusetithayinnee gomppay pettii qara. Kiitanchchay katamito fa gufera yhadhdheeza, katamay nam77ii mukulo oyddii xeet kilo mitire maaqqeeza; katamitii adusetithay, dalggatithaynnee dhoqqatithay yey garkk pettii mala. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Kiitanchchay ginbbe gassay yuusha as kusher yhadhdhin pettii xeetannee oytamanne oydd yhadha maaqqeeza, yeykka kiitanchay yhadhara.<verse eid="REV 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>Katamay ginbbe yasphphiide giz shuchchar gasintteeza. Katamay burcuko garkk pociz geeshsh worqqar oosintteeza. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>Katamitii gimbbayis baasay ubbay bonchchintteez shuchchar yegeliseeza. Tiina hiixintteez shuchchay yasphphiide, nam7inthay sanppeere, hadzinthay kelqqedonee, oyddinthay mergede, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>ichchinthay sarddonkise, usuppunthay sarddoone, laappunthay kiristiloobe, hosppunthay birille, uddufunthay worawure, taphphinthay kirisiphiraasise, taphpho pettinithay Yaakintte, taphpho nam7anthay Ametesxinoose.<verse eid="REV 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>Taphpho nam77ii pengitayis taphpho nam7ii inqitay yeza. Pettii pettii pengay pettii inqor oosintteeza. Katamitii ogay lo77o burcuko garkk pociz tilla worqqapp oosintteeza.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Goday, Ubbaypp Wolqqama Xoossaynnee Duray katamits keethe maaqqeez gishos ta ye katamite hara keeth be7ekkaya. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Xooss bonchcho ye katamitis poo7iza gishonnee Duray Iis xomppe maaqqeez gishos katamitis awa woy agina poo7o koshshooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Isa. 60:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/>Woyitay ye katamittii poo7or yedhdhoda; alame kaatitaykka fa bonchcha ged ezayid ko7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">Isa. 60:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Qamma ezayid baa gishos katama pengitay ubba wode dooya maaqqada; gorddinttaam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:11">Isa. 60:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Kaatitay gitatithaynnee bonchchay ye katamite geloda 9. <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>Durayis maaqqeezayinnee de7o maxaafayid sunthay xaafintteezitay aaddapp attin tunabaz woy piilinttizabaz ootheez woy worddo odiz oonkka ye katamito yesha gelaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa. 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Iziqe. 44:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o haathinnee mith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Yeypp guye, kiitanchchay tana Xooss zufaanayppennee Duray zufaanaypp goggiz burcuko garkk pociz gita de7o haath ta beezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Iziqe. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak. 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>Ye haathata ye katamitii waanna goossa qoo7ii aadhiza. Ye haathatis ushach baggarannee haddiris baggar laytha taphpho nam77ii toke aginar aginar aafiz de7o mithii yeza. Ye mithatii hayitay woya pathiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Medhe. 2:9</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pettii pettii Grike maxapitayid ye de7o mithay Katama waana goossayisinnee goggiz hathyis gancce yeza yeegiza.</char></note><verse eid="REV 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>Yhanpp guye aba baadithii yezaamii. Xooss zufaanaynnee Duray zufaanay ye katamayid yezoda. E ayllitay Eza goynnoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:10">Zak. 14:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>Unttii e aafa be7ada; e sunthay u sinol xaafinttoda. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Yikkepp guye qamma baaya; Goda Xoossay unttis poo7iza maaqqeez gishos unttis xomppe woy awa poo7o koshshooya. Unttii medhdhii medhinas kawutoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Isa. 60:19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:18">Daan. 7:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa maaqqii yi7ith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Yeypp guye Kiitanchchay taako, «Yha ta odiza qaalay ammantteezitannee tumita. Goda Xoossay, nabitayis fa Ayyanar inggizay, ukker attekka hanod baz fa ayllita beessadayis fa kiitanchcha azazeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>Yesuusakka, «Yeezako ta eller ye7oda; yha maxaafayid yez tinbbite qaala naagiza oonkka anjjintteezaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Ta, Waannisa, ye ubbabaza si7eezannee be7eeza. Taanii yeya si7eez wodennee be7eez wode yeya tana beezeez kiitanchcha goynnodayis e tokayil afa guphinggeeza. <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Zini kiitanchchay taako, «Ashshoba! Yeya oothippe! Taanii ne garkke, ne ishitay nabitay garkkennee yha maxaafayid yez ubba kiitinttiza ayllitay garkke; Xoossis goynnoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="REV 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Yhaypp guye Kiitanchchay mahii, «Yha ubbay polinttiza woday ukkeez gishos yha maxaafayid xaafintteez tinbbite qaala maatamer gorddippe. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/>Iita oothizay gujjii iita ootho; tunaykka gujjii tuno. Xillaykka gujjii xillo; geezhizay gujjii geezho» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Daan. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>Yesuusa, «Yeezako, taanii ellisii ye7oda. Pettayis pettayis e oosay garkk immad woyitay taar yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:10">Isa. 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:4">Maz. 28:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Erim. 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/>Taanii Alfannee Oomega; Tiinannee Guya; Dendonnee wursitha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Wan. Qon. 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>«Fa ma7a meeccii geeshsheezitay anjjintteezita. De7o mith aafa maadayisinnee katamit pengitayir gelodayis unttis mawute inggitteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Medhe. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>Zini kanitay, bitizitay, lagitizitay, shemppo wodhizitay, eeqa goynnizitay, worddo dosizitayinnee oothizitay baler yeza.<verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>«Ta, Yesuusa, yha markkatitha yinttis, woosa keethitayis ododay garkk ta kiitanchcha kiiteeza. Taanii Dawute sheeshinnee zerithi. Taanii poo7iza guura bakkala xoolintta» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>Ayyaanaynnee gelodayis giigeez maachchat, «Yhana ye7oba» yeegiza. Ma yhaya si7iz oonkka, «Yhana ye7oba» yeego. Saamintteez oonkka yhana ye7o; de7o haath koyiz oonkka ciga bayth cer ekkii uzho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Taanii yha maxaafayid xaafintteez tinbbite qaala si7iz oonakka naaginttoday garkk markattiza. Oonkka yha qaalayil afa pettibaz gujjiko, Xoossii yha maxaafayid xaafintteez bosha ezal afa gujjoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Nam7i. 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Oonkka maxaafayid yez tinbbite qaalaypp pettibaz pacinchiko, Xoossii yha maxaafayid xaafintteez de7o mith aafeppennee geesh katamitipp e anja pacinthoda.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Yha ubba markkattizay, «Tuma, taanii ellisii ye7oda» yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amin77ii; Goda Yesuusa, ye7oda.<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Goda Yesuus aadho keehatithay nu ubbayir maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
